<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">aicompanion</ansi>

Administers bonded AI companions (modules/aicompanion).

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Usage ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">aicompanion status</ansi>               Module state, today's usage, each companion.
  <ansi fg="command">aicompanion profiles</ansi>             Companion profiles that loaded.
  <ansi fg="command">aicompanion grant <char> <profile></ansi>  Bond a companion to an online player.
  <ansi fg="command">aicompanion revoke <char></ansi>        Remove it (its memories stay on disk).
  <ansi fg="command">aicompanion pause|resume <char></ansi>  Stop or restart its model calls.
  <ansi fg="command">aicompanion mind <char></ansi>          Opinion scores, memories, facts, promises.
  <ansi fg="command">aicompanion trace <char></ansi>         Its recent decisions: tier, model, intent.
  <ansi fg="command">aicompanion prompt <char></ansi>        The full last request sent to the model.
  <ansi fg="command">aicompanion models</ansi>               Model routing per tier, and metrics.
  <ansi fg="command">aicompanion breaker reset</ansi>        Resume model calls after repeated errors.

The prompt view contains what players said. Treat it as private.
